      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I just tried another test using Unity making a basic cube floor using Pro Builder and the inbuilt Unity Cube object.\nPro Builder: Doesn't show anything\nCube: Works and you can see the floor.\nBelow are images you can see I am standing on the Unity cube floor looking at the unity cube which is placed above a Pro Builder floor.\nThe Pro Builder Object Mesh's are missing but the Unity Cube is showing fine.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
