      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just tried a lower Pro Builder version and it works fine.\nSo there is a bug in either Pro Builder or VRChat working with the latest Pro Builder models.\nThe version of Pro Builder that is bugged and showing meshes and invisible is the latest 'Pro Builder 4.3.0-Preview.2' which has a very critical fix for vertices disappearing and error'ing when merging objects together.\nHere is a screenshot of Pro Builder 4.2.3 working.\nI have posted this on both here in the Canny and on Unity's World Building forum.\nhttps://forum.unity.com/threads/cant-generate-uvs-and-invisible-meshes-vrchat.824949/#post-5462247",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
